{"articleNo":"47580","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=47580&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년도 Young KSPians(1기) 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.04.06","hit":"5018","attachments":[{"name":"공고문.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=47580&attachNo=70339"},{"name":"포스터.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=47580&attachNo=70580"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">한국개발연구원에서는&nbsp;기획재정부와&nbsp;공동으로&nbsp;개발도상국들의&nbsp;경제사회&nbsp;발전을&nbsp;지원하고&nbsp;우리나라와의&nbsp;경제협력을&nbsp;증진하고자&nbsp;협력대상국&nbsp;경제에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;연구와&nbsp;정책자문,&nbsp;교육연수를&nbsp;실시하는 경제발전경험&nbsp;공유사업(KSP)을&nbsp;2004년부터&nbsp;수행하고&nbsp;있으며, 청년인재들이&nbsp;동&nbsp;사업에&nbsp;직접&nbsp;참여하여&nbsp;다양한&nbsp;현지&nbsp;경험을&nbsp;쌓고&nbsp;능력을&nbsp;배양하며 미래&nbsp;국제개발협력&nbsp;전문가로서&nbsp;활약할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있는&nbsp;역량을&nbsp;제고&nbsp;기회를&nbsp;제공하고자,&nbsp;본원은&nbsp;기획재정부와&nbsp;공동으로&nbsp;Young&nbsp;KSPians(YKSP)&nbsp;사업을&nbsp;신설하였다하오니,&nbsp;관심있는 학생은 참여하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">첨&nbsp;부&nbsp;:&nbsp;1.&nbsp;YKSP&nbsp;1기&nbsp;공고문&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2.&nbsp;YKSP&nbsp;포스터.&nbsp;끝.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
